        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f3fb3a0-990f-42c5-b28b-63ac6390ab46).Image",
        "Description": "47, I got intel\r\rFormer CICADA agent, Tsuneto Ozaki who was on duty on the Sanguine fashion show disappeard into thin air after the assasination of Viktor Novikov and Dalia Margolis. We suspect that he has ties to Edwards and Providence. His associate, Ellinor Yasuda who helped Jonathan Smythe for years got him to Sanguine fashion show to be assasinated. We suspect both of them of betraying CICADA and the ICA. Approach as you please.\r\rGood luck 47.",
